zephyr-backports security layer for zephyr v2.3.0 (optional)

The tree difference between ZephyrProtocol/zephyr v2.3.0 (67c5f53b) and
zephyr-backports/zephyr v2.3.0-sec.2 (8c6a1202), without the fork-only files (.github,
README.md, SECURITY-BACKPORTS.md) and without the RandomX submodule bump, which
scripts/setup_tree.sh applies itself (102f8acf -> 12f2c2ff). Advisories SB-001..SB-010 and
SB-015..SB-034 of zephyr-backports/zephyr-backports backports/advisories.tsv.

